      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, but it feels a bit too brief. Can you make it more formal and assertive? I want to include a mention that if they don't fix it within a specific timeframe, I might have to look into reducing my rent (Mietminderung) or contacting a tenant association. Also, can you add a placeholder for a deadline, like within 3 business days? I want to make sure they understand this is a serious matter and not just a casual suggestion.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
