      "content": "Here's a revised draft:\n\nDear [Hausverwaltung],\n\nI am writing to bring to your attention a pressing maintenance issue regarding the radiator in the living room of my apartment at [Your Address]. Unfortunately, the radiator has ceased to function since yesterday, resulting in an unacceptable reduction in living space and comfort. I respectfully request that you arrange for the necessary repairs to be carried out without undue delay, specifically within the next 3 business days, as the current temperature is becoming increasingly uncomfortable and affecting my well-being.\n\nI would like to emphasize that as a tenant, I am entitled to a functioning heating system as a basic standard of living. Failure to address this issue within the specified timeframe may prompt me to consider exploring alternative measures, including reducing my rent or seeking support from a tenant association. I hope we can resolve this matter amicably and promptly.\n\nPlease confirm receipt of this letter and indicate the expected timeline for addressing this issue.\n\nSincerely,\n[Your Name]",
